---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Chronicle | Wyatt Entrekin">
  <section class="project-shell">
    <a class="back-link reveal" href="/projects"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Projects</a>

    <section class="project-hero reveal glass-card">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-kicker">In Progress</p>
        <h1>Chronicle</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          An AI-powered agentic workflow for transcription, speaker-diarization, and thematic organization that
          supports my ongoing family history documentation work.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span>Agentic Workflows</span>
          <span>AI Engineering</span>
          <span>Family History</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <span class="status-pill">In Progress</span>
        <a
          class="icon-link"
          href="https://github.com/wmentrekin/chronicle/tree/main"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          aria-label="GitHub Repository"
          title="GitHub Repository"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.58 2 12.24c0 4.53 2.87 8.37 6.84 9.73.5.09.68-.22.68-.49 0-.24-.01-1.05-.01-1.9-2.78.62-3.37-1.21-3.37-1.21-.45-1.18-1.11-1.49-1.11-1.49-.91-.64.07-.63.07-.63 1 .07 1.53 1.05 1.53 1.05.9 1.57 2.36 1.12 2.94.86.09-.67.35-1.12.63-1.38-2.22-.26-4.55-1.14-4.55-5.06 0-1.12.39-2.03 1.03-2.75-.1-.26-.45-1.31.1-2.73 0 0 .84-.28 2.75 1.05A9.3 9.3 0 0 1 12 6.86c.85 0 1.71.12 2.51.35 1.91-1.33 2.75-1.05 2.75-1.05.55 1.42.2 2.47.1 2.73.64.72 1.03 1.63 1.03 2.75 0 3.93-2.33 4.8-4.56 5.05.36.32.68.95.68 1.92 0 1.39-.01 2.5-.01 2.84 0 .27.18.59.69.49A10.13 10.13 0 0 0 22 12.24C22 6.58 17.52 2 12 2Z"
              fill="currentColor"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card reveal glass-card">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        I have always been interested in ancestry research and personal family history. I am lucky enough
        to have a number of family members who have spent a lot of time before me documenting and recording our family's history.
        I was specifically inspired by some of my great uncle's work creating a life story document of his father, my great-grandfather,
        helped immensely by recordings and writings taken during his lifetime. I was amazed at how much I felt like I got to know about him,
        despite never having met him. When I have children one day, I want them to be able to know who my grandparents actually were, not just see them
        as characters in a story. So I decided that when I'm able, I want to interview my grandparents and eventually other family members to capture their stories and memories.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Chronicle exists to solve a very specific personal problem: I am collecting hours of recorded interviews with family
        members about our family's history, and turning raw audio like that into something actually reviewable 
        (a real transcript, with the right person's name attached to the right words) is slow, tedious
        work if done by hand, and not something I wanted to hand over wholesale to a third-party cloud service given
        how personal the subject matter is. Chronicle is my answer: a multi-stage agentic pipeline,
        driven entirely through a CLI (<code>chronicle &lt;command&gt; &lt;session_id&gt;</code>), that takes a
        session's raw audio and, stage by stage, turns it into structured, reviewable source material.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        The pipeline is organized into four stages, and each one only ever depends on the stage before it. Stage 1
        transcribes the raw audio (with interchangeable backends: faster-whisper and Parakeet are both
        supported). Stage 2 diarizes it, working out who was speaking and when, using a local SpeechBrain model by
        default, with Pyannote available for benchmarking against it. Stage 3 is where it gets interesting: it takes
        those anonymous diarized speakers and maps them to real people from a participants roster, using a local
        LLM (Ollama running <code>qwen3:8b</code>) that reasons over transcript excerpts, evidence, and session
        context. Stage 4, still just a scaffold today, is where an identified transcript will eventually become an organized narrative rather than a flat wall of text.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        This project is still very much a work in progress as I continue to refine each stage, experiment with different models, and running them locally vs with cloud VMs.
        Its been a fun way to explore my family history while also learning more about agentic workflows and AI Engineering. Keep checking in to see updates as this project evolves!
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>

  <style>
    .project-shell {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-top: 0.8rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .project-hero {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.05rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0.45rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 0.96;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .hero-text {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 34rem;
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .hero-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
    }

    .hero-tags span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 1.75rem;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.58rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .status-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 1.85rem;
      padding: 0.14rem 0.68rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .icon-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 1.85rem;
      height: 1.85rem;
      padding: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
    }

    .icon-link:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    }

    .icon-link svg {
      width: 0.95rem;
      height: 0.95rem;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .construction-note {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .construction-note strong {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-right: 0.5rem;
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 1.3rem;
    }

    .info-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .info-card p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .info-card p + p {
      margin-top: 0.85rem;
    }

    .info-card code {
      padding: 0.08rem 0.32rem;
      border-radius: 0.35rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .project-hero {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .info-card {
        padding: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
